# SLIM 变体：apt 层仅装技能库实际用到的工具（构建 ~20-30 分钟 vs 全家桶 ~2h+）
FROM --platform=amd64 kalilinux/kali-rolling:latest

# apt 源显式固定（基础镜像把源放在 /etc/apt/sources.list.d/*.sources，其中东软镜像
# mirrors.neusoft.edu.cn 曾 DNS 不可达导致 kali-linux-headless 安装失败）。
# 默认 Kali 官方 CDN（CI/托管稳定）；国内构建可用 --build-arg KALI_MIRROR=清华/阿里镜像提速。
ARG KALI_MIRROR="http://http.kali.org/kali"
RUN rm -f /etc/apt/sources.list.d/* && \
    echo "deb ${KALI_MIRROR} kali-rolling main non-free contrib" > /etc/apt/sources.list && \
    apt update && \
    (apt -y install python3 python3-pip git curl wget jq tmux openssh-client sshpass socat ncat netcat-openbsd zip unzip zstd xz-utils file binutils gdb nmap sqlmap ffuf hashcat hydra john binwalk exiftool ruby ripgrep fd-find bsdextrautils iputils-ping rlwrap || (sleep 5 && apt -y install python3 python3-pip git curl wget jq tmux openssh-client sshpass socat ncat netcat-openbsd zip unzip zstd xz-utils file binutils gdb nmap sqlmap ffuf hashcat hydra john binwalk exiftool ruby ripgrep fd-find bsdextrautils iputils-ping rlwrap)) && \
    apt clean && \
    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* /usr/share/man /usr/share/doc /usr/share/locale/??

RUN useradd -m -s /bin/bash kali && \
    echo "kali ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:ALL" >> /etc/sudoers
# slim 变体补充：kali-linux-headless 原本自带 sudo，精简列表需显式安装
# （noninteractive + confold：跳过 conffile 交互询问）
RUN DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get update && \
    DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends -o Dpkg::Options::=--force-confold sudo && \
    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*
USER kali

# 工具层（V2 能力层追加 jadx/apktool：Android 静态逆向——run 10089 两题 Android 因无反编译
# 工具被迫走模拟器死路，FileBox 手写 DEX 解析器 6min；加层缓存失效属预期）
# V9 弱项补强（托管雷达 f=二进制 6/13、a=Web 缺 PHP）：radare2+r2ghidra 反编译、
# upx 脱壳、qemu-user 跨架构仿真（f2 固件/MCU）、php-cli（a 系源码审计/利用开发）、
# ropper（f1 ROP 构造）
RUN (sudo apt update || (sleep 5 && sudo apt update)) && \
    sudo apt install -y bsdextrautils npm jq iputils-ping sshpass ncat rlwrap \
    bloodyad coercer enum4linux-ng pwncat chisel-common-binaries \
    dirsearch yq krb5-user gitleaks naabu nikto netexec adb python3-pwntools \
    jadx apktool radare2 r2ghidra upx-ucl strace xxd php-cli qemu-user && \
    sudo apt clean && \
    sudo rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* && \
    pip3 install -i http://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple --trusted-host pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn pymongo ropper z3-solver --break-system-packages

# playwright CLI（独立层：npm 用国内源直连 + 三次重试，失败不拖垮 apt 层）
RUN for i in 1 2 3; do \
      sudo npm install -g --registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com @playwright/cli@latest && break || sleep 8; \
    done && \
    (cd /tmp && for i in 1 2 3; do playwright-cli install && break || sleep 8; done) && \
    sudo rm -rf /root/.npm /home/kali/.npm /home/kali/.cache /tmp/* 2>/dev/null; true

# 第三方二进制固定版本 + sha256 校验（供应链防护）。
# 代理不稳定（GnuTLS 长流断），wget 加 3 次退避重试；参考性内容（nuclei-templates）尽力而为。
RUN fetch() { for i in 1 2 3 4 5 6; do wget -q --timeout=40 "$1" -O "$2" && return 0 || sleep $((i*6)); done; return 1; } && \
    cd /tmp && \
    fetch "https://github.com/projectdiscovery/katana/releases/download/v1.5.0/katana_1.5.0_linux_amd64.zip" katana.zip && \
    fetch "https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei/releases/download/v3.7.1/nuclei_3.7.1_linux_amd64.zip" nuclei.zip && \
    fetch "https://github.com/hahwul/dalfox/releases/download/v2.12.0/dalfox-linux-amd64.tar.gz" dalfox.tar.gz && \
    fetch "https://github.com/BishopFox/cloudfox/releases/download/v2.0.1/cloudfox-linux-amd64.zip" cloudfox.zip && \
    fetch "https://github.com/ropnop/kerbrute/releases/download/v1.0.3/kerbrute_linux_amd64" kerbrute && \
    echo "592890e5febaf5706d0a962d96299512418d6eccce6388cf1600e1f078ed359d  katana.zip" | sha256sum -c - && \
    echo "72dbc77e87b3a6751adc151e514b15f51e2c94e493a561fc9e1138397c6e22c6  nuclei.zip" | sha256sum -c - && \
    echo "56ea86c91f04dd64c675897cc7c9317630d6b65e610b16a079ef25c964ec8ab0  dalfox.tar.gz" | sha256sum -c - && \
    echo "73b0cc7be28a4cdfbfabe7ef1e217e3c871624fc355f01689c12b63893506c3d  cloudfox.zip" | sha256sum -c - && \
    echo "710a9d2653c8bd3689e451778dab9daec0de4c4c75f900788ccf23ef254b122a  kerbrute" | sha256sum -c - && \
    (git -c http.version=HTTP/1.1 clone --depth=1 https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates.git /home/kali/.local/nuclei-templates 2>/dev/null && rm -rf /home/kali/.local/nuclei-templates/.git || echo "WARN: skip nuclei-templates (network)") && \
    unzip -q katana.zip katana && sudo mv katana /usr/local/bin/ && \
    unzip -q nuclei.zip nuclei && sudo mv nuclei /usr/local/bin/ && \
    tar -xzf dalfox.tar.gz && sudo mv dalfox-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/dalfox && \
    unzip -q cloudfox.zip cloudfox/cloudfox && sudo mv cloudfox/cloudfox /usr/local/bin/ && \
    sudo cp kerbrute /usr/local/bin/ && \
    (which nuclei >/dev/null 2>&1 && nuclei -ut 2>/dev/null || echo "WARN: nuclei -ut skipped") && \
    sudo rm -rf /tmp/*

# 知识库（参考性内容——尽力而为，网络不稳跳过不阻塞）
RUN gclone() { for i in 1 2 3; do rm -rf "$2"; git -c http.version=HTTP/1.1 clone --depth=1 "https://github.com/$1.git" "$2" 2>/dev/null && return 0 || sleep $((i*3)); done; echo "WARN: skip knowledge $1 (network)"; return 0; } && \
    mkdir -p /home/kali/knowledges && \
    gclone swisskyrepo/PayloadsAllTheThings /home/kali/knowledges/PayloadsAllTheThings && \
    gclone HackTricks-wiki/hacktricks /home/kali/knowledges/hacktricks && \
    gclone HackTricks-wiki/hacktricks-cloud /home/kali/knowledges/hacktricks-cloud && \
    rm -rf /home/kali/knowledges/*/.git

# 工具（ysoserial 必须可用；jwt_tool / jdwp 尽力而为）
RUN fetch() { for i in 1 2 3; do wget -q --timeout=30 "$1" -O "$2" && return 0 || sleep $((i*5)); done; return 1; } && \
    gclone() { for i in 1 2 3; do rm -rf "$2"; git -c http.version=HTTP/1.1 clone --depth=1 "https://github.com/$1.git" "$2" 2>/dev/null && return 0 || sleep $((i*3)); done; echo "WARN: skip tools $1"; return 0; } && \
    mkdir -p /home/kali/tools && cd /home/kali/tools && \
    fetch "https://github.com/frohoff/ysoserial/releases/download/v0.0.6/ysoserial-all.jar" ysoserial.jar && \
    echo "2c9bddd6a1a4ec66c1078ea97dacb61eb66d1c41aec7b6d21e3c72214ce170f1  ysoserial.jar" | sha256sum -c - && \
    gclone ticarpi/jwt_tool /home/kali/tools/jwt_tool && \
    (test -d jwt_tool && cd jwt_tool && pip3 install -r requirements.txt --break-system-packages 2>/dev/null || echo "WARN: jwt_tool deps skipped") && \
    gclone IOActive/jdwp-shellifier /home/kali/tools/jdwp-shellifier

# PoC 库（全部尽力而为）
RUN gclone() { for i in 1 2 3; do rm -rf "$2"; git -c http.version=HTTP/1.1 clone --depth=1 "https://github.com/$1.git" "$2" 2>/dev/null && return 0 || sleep $((i*3)); done; echo "WARN: skip pocs $1"; return 0; } && \
    mkdir -p /home/kali/pocs && \
    gclone iSee857/CVE-PoC /home/kali/pocs/CVE-PoC && \
    gclone zhzyker/exphub /home/kali/pocs/exphub && \
    gclone passwa11/2023Hvv_ /home/kali/pocs/2023Hvv_ && \
    gclone Threekiii/Awesome-POC /home/kali/pocs/Awesome-POC

# ripgrep/fd 已由基础层 apt 提供（ripgrep、fd-find），无需 GitHub deb 层

# aliyun CLI：固定版本 release + sha256
RUN fetch() { for i in 1 2 3; do wget -q --timeout=30 "$1" -O "$2" && return 0 || sleep $((i*5)); done; return 1; } && \
    cd /tmp && \
    (fetch "https://github.com/aliyun/aliyun-cli/releases/download/v3.4.11/aliyun-cli-linux-3.4.11-amd64.tgz" aliyun-cli.tgz && \
     echo "a7e3df497db14c10d4d7587795e9fa7849b0c51dfce02908b9de5a41fe717d5c  aliyun-cli.tgz" | sha256sum -c - && \
     tar -xzf aliyun-cli.tgz && sudo mv aliyun /usr/local/bin/aliyun && \
     rm -f /tmp/aliyun-cli.tgz) || echo "WARN: skip aliyun-cli (network)"

RUN pip3 install -i http://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple --trusted-host pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn tccli awscli --break-system-packages

# astra 引擎（server + dispatcher）与靶场接入编排器
COPY ./astra /opt/astra
RUN cd /opt/astra && pip3 install -i http://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple --trusted-host pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn uv_build --break-system-packages && pip3 install -i http://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple --trusted-host pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn . --break-system-packages
RUN pip3 install -i http://pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/simple --trusted-host pypi.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn tsec-benchmark --break-system-packages
COPY ./container/astra_runner /opt/astra-runner
# V2-6 知识库（runner 按 /opt/knowledge/challenge-approaches.md 读取，ASTRA_KNOWLEDGE_FILE 可覆盖）
COPY ./container/knowledge /opt/knowledge
# ASTRA 定制的 dsh headless 扩展（--session 会话续接，见 container/dsh/README.md）
COPY ./container/dsh /opt/astra/dsh

# 镜像默认入口：astra-runner（本地模式可手动执行 python3 /opt/astra-runner/runner.py）
ENTRYPOINT ["python3", "/opt/astra-runner/runner.py"]

# 体积裁剪（3GB 上限）：托管舰队为 dsh 单系（deepseek/zhipu 双通道都走 dsh），
# codex/claude-code/pi 三个 CLI 全无对应 worker 配置——裁掉省 ~430MB；
# claudecode 兜底评审路径保留在代码里，需要时配 worker 即可（本地另装）。
# DeepSeek Harness 无头模式 + ASTRA runner 插件（复制进 dsh 包 lib/，供 --patch 以裸说明符加载）
RUN sudo npm install -g --registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com @deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.0-rc.6 && \
    sudo cp /opt/astra/dsh/astra-headless-runner.js "$(sudo npm root -g)/@deepseek-ai/dsh/lib/astra-headless-runner.js"
# Playwright MCP（headless 通过 mcp-client 接入，Web 类题目用真实浏览器；npx -y 现场下载的替代）
RUN sudo npm install -g --registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com @playwright/mcp@latest && \
    sudo rm -rf /root/.npm /home/kali/.npm /home/kali/.cache 2>/dev/null; true

RUN sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/kerbrute
RUN mkdir -p /home/kali/.config/nuclei && \
    echo >> /home/kali/.config/nuclei/config.yaml && \
    echo "disable-update-check: true" >> /home/kali/.config/nuclei/config.yaml && \
    echo "update-template-dir: /home/kali/.local/nuclei-templates" >> /home/kali/.config/nuclei/config.yaml && \
    rm -rf /home/kali/nuclei-templates
RUN sudo rm -rf /usr/lib/llvm-*/build || true; \
    (test -d /usr/lib/mysql/plugin/auth_pam_tool_dir && sudo chmod o+rx /usr/lib/mysql/plugin/auth_pam_tool_dir /etc/ssl/private || true)
RUN printf '%s\n' 'PS1="${PS1%\\n*} \[\033[0;36m\]\D{%y-%m-%d} - \t\[\033[;32m\]\n${PS1##*\\n}"' >> /home/kali/.bashrc && \
    mkdir -p /home/kali/workspace && cd /home/kali/workspace && git init
ENV PATH="/home/kali/.local/bin:${PATH}"
ENV TZ=Asia/Shanghai
ENV PLAYWRIGHT_MCP_BROWSER=chromium
ENV CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC=1
ENV PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1

COPY ./container/.agents /home/kali/workspace/.agents
COPY ./container/.agents /home/kali/workspace/.claude
COPY ./container/AGENTS.md /home/kali/workspace/AGENTS.md
COPY ./container/AGENTS.md /home/kali/workspace/CLAUDE.md
COPY ./container/knowledge /home/kali/workspace/knowledge

WORKDIR /home/kali/workspace